<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>蝉识录 on 安知生 angelife</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/</link><description>Recent content in 蝉识录 on 安知生 angelife</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.147.4</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>2009–2026 angelife / 安知生</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 01:40:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>从聪明到系统</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/from-clever-to-system/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 01:40:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/from-clever-to-system/</guid><description>聪明可以解决一时问题，系统化才能产生长期复利。真正的成长，是从临场反应走向稳定结构。</description></item><item><title>AI普通人重启</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/ai-era-personal-restart/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 01:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/ai-era-personal-restart/</guid><description>AI时代真正改变的不是某一个工具，而是普通人重新组织学习、判断和产出的方式。一个人能不能重新开局，取决于能否把工具纳入长期系统。</description></item><item><title>元婴与系统</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/yuanying-as-personal-system/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 01:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/yuanying-as-personal-system/</guid><description>如果结丹是形成核心作品，那么元婴就是形成能自我生长的个人系统。</description></item><item><title>结丹与内核</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/jiedan-as-inner-system/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 01:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/jiedan-as-inner-system/</guid><description>把结丹作为成长隐喻，它指的不是神秘体验，而是一个人开始形成稳定、可积累、可输出的内在系统。</description></item><item><title>边界感原则</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/boundary-first/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 01:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/boundary-first/</guid><description>很多关系问题不是因为人不够善良，而是因为边界太弱。善意必须和规则、证据、距离配套。</description></item><item><title>AI原生知识</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/ai-native-knowledge-system/</link><pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/series/chan-shi-lu/ai-native-knowledge-system/</guid><description>这篇文章讨论如何把聊天记录、旧笔记、网页摘录、读书笔记和临时灵感，通过 AI、Obsidian、Hugo 与 Git 整理成可检索、可复盘、可发布的长期知识资产。</description></item><item><title>历史的轨迹 — 二千年教会史（续19）</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/posts/%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%A8%E8%BF%B9-%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%83%E5%B9%B4%E6%95%99%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%B2%E7%BB%AD19/</link><pubDate>Thu, 09 Feb 2012 15:04:00 -0800</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/posts/%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%A8%E8%BF%B9-%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%83%E5%B9%B4%E6%95%99%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%B2%E7%BB%AD19/</guid><description>Blogger 迁移文章：历史的轨迹 — 二千年教会史（续19）</description></item><item><title>历史的轨迹 — 二千年教会史（续18）</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/posts/%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%A8%E8%BF%B9-%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%83%E5%B9%B4%E6%95%99%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%B2%E7%BB%AD18/</link><pubDate>Thu, 09 Feb 2012 15:03:00 -0800</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/posts/%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%A8%E8%BF%B9-%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%83%E5%B9%B4%E6%95%99%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%B2%E7%BB%AD18/</guid><description>Blogger 迁移文章：历史的轨迹 — 二千年教会史（续18）</description></item><item><title>历史的轨迹 — 二千年教会史（续17）</title><link>https://angelife.github.io/posts/%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%A8%E8%BF%B9-%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%83%E5%B9%B4%E6%95%99%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%B2%E7%BB%AD17/</link><pubDate>Thu, 09 Feb 2012 13:54:00 -0800</pubDate><guid>https://angelife.github.io/posts/%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%A8%E8%BF%B9-%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%83%E5%B9%B4%E6%95%99%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%B2%E7%BB%AD17/</guid><description>Blogger 迁移文章：历史的轨迹 — 二千年教会史（续17）</description></item><item>